<title>USA: IPO PRICING-STAR Telecom below range at $9.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING-STAR Telecom below range at $9.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA BARBARA, Calif. 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	STAR Telecommunications Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					    $9</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range		 $10 - $12</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			4.0 million</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	  Hambrecht &amp; Quist Inc</p>
<p>NOTE:  The company said that of the 4.0 million shares, 3.75 million are being sold by the company and 250,000 are being sold by certain stockholders.</p>
<p>The company and certain of the selling stockholders have granted the underwriters an option to purchase up to an additional 600,000 shares to cover over-allotments.</p>
<p>STAR is an international long-distance provider offering switched-voice services on a wholesale basis, primarily to U.S.-based long-distance carriers.</p>
</text>
